# Pages voice

- Never put the word Host in user-facing copy under `apps/pages`.
- A connector action the browser can perform does not call a paired Host and does not tell the person to pair one. Creating a GitHub App posts the manifest from this page.
- Do not add explainer or caption prose: no sentence under a title, button, or field that describes what the control will do.
- Do not render an in-page error box (`note`, `conn-flash`, paragraph banner). A failure is a `StatusMark`. The sentence is `aria-label` and `title`.
